  "details": "Description\n\nSo im on an ipad mobile and when i try moving the joystick to walk im not moving, the jump buttons also not working. Everything else seems to be fine though.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. Open VRChat on ipad, 2. Join a world, 3. Try moving with the touchscreen joystick, 4. Notice the character doesn’t move, 5. Try the jump button, 6. Notice it doesnt work. Currently no workaround. Restarting, updating,reinstalling, switching worlds, and checking settings didn’t fix it. Emotes, chat, and menus still work.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: iOSMobile (platform: iOS - Mobile, store: TestFlight, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: IPhonePlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.10100\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-08_22-34-57.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_97e72dba-b63d-4b9f-8e1d-00a77e2c5065/1/file)",
